@mod hermes_report.trace :: Tracing wrappers that record what every phase of the pipeline sees and returns
@ext hermes_core, hermes_enrich, hermes_generator

D StoreRead [frozen] :: One ``fetch_ranges`` call: the ranges asked for and the chunks returned
  a ranges: tuple[ChunkRange, ...]; returned: tuple[ContextChunk, ...]; seconds: float

D EnrichStep [frozen] :: One enrichment technique: its input, its output and its store reads
  a name: str; phase: EnrichmentPhase; before: EnrichedContext; after: EnrichedContext
  a reads: tuple[StoreRead, ...]; seconds: float

D LLMCall [frozen] :: One LLM completion: what was sent and what came back
  a messages: tuple[PromptMessage, ...]; params: GenerationParams; reply: LLMReply | None; error: str | None
  a seconds: float

D Trace :: Everything recorded during one ``enrich`` call and one ``generate`` call
  a steps: list[EnrichStep] = field(default_factory=list)
  a context: EnrichedContext | None = None
  a request: AnswerRequest | None = None
  a outcome: StrategyOutcome | None = None
  a llm_calls: list[LLMCall] = field(default_factory=list)

C TracingEnricher :: Enricher that runs ``inner`` and records its input, output and reads
