  a name: str; phase: EnrichmentPhase
  m enrich(query: UserQuery, context: EnrichedContext, store: ChunkStore) -> EnrichedContext :: Run the wrapped technique and record the step

C TracingStrategy :: Strategy that runs ``inner`` and records its request and outcome
  m __init__(inner: GenerationStrategy, trace: Trace) :: Wrap ``inner``; the wrapper takes its ``name``
  a name: str
  m generate(request: AnswerRequest, llm: LLMClient) -> StrategyOutcome :: Run the wrapped strategy and record what it received and produced

C TracingLLM :: LLM client that forwards every call to ``inner`` and records it
  m __init__(inner: LLMClient, trace: Trace) :: Wrap ``inner``
  m complete(messages: Sequence[PromptMessage], params: GenerationParams) -> LLMReply :: Call the wrapped client; the call is recorded also when it fails
